RTKLIB (RTKLIB-EX / rtklibexplorer)
https://github.com/rtklibexplorer/RTKLIB

This package statically links RTKLIB and installs its public header. The pinned
submodule is unchanged; cmake/rtklib_*.cmake applies package-specific changes to
build-tree copies (receiver decoding, navigation, RINEX, streams and diagnostics).
These modified copies are not the unmodified upstream RTKLIB distribution.
The upstream copyright notice and license follow verbatim.


